2026-07-30 22:02:22.913 UTC [55640] LOG:  duration: 1.194 ms  bind <unnamed>: SELECT DISTINCT ON (project_id) project_id, project_name FROM (
	       -- Explicit sprint assignee_ids
	       SELECT (s.properties->>'project_id')::uuid as project_id, proj.title as project_name
